  "goodToKnow": "Der Wohnort is your place of residence, the town where you live, a standard field on forms: Name, Vorname, Geburtsdatum, Wohnort. The legal term is der Wohnsitz: der erste Wohnsitz or Hauptwohnsitz (main residence), which you must register at the Bürgeramt. Your birthplace is der Geburtsort. A student might have their Wohnort in the university town and their Heimatort elsewhere. Plural: die Wohnorte."
